 "remarks": "IMMACULATE & PERFECT!! Nestled on a charming cul-de-sac close to town, this lovely and meticulously maintained 4-bedroom home offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience. Set on a level acre in a picturesque setting, the home features a welcoming open floor plan with sun-filled living spaces that flow effortlessly, creating an inviting setting for both everyday living and entertaining. Lovingly cared for and truly move-in ready, this home exudes warmth and timeless appeal throughout. Step outside to a lovely terrace overlooking the beautiful property, where mature landscaping, and classic stone walls create a serene park-like backdrop. Whether hosting friends, enjoying family gatherings, or simply unwinding outdoors, the setting is both peaceful and inviting. With its thoughtful design, beautiful surroundings, and desirable location close to town and schools, this special property offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the very best of New Canaan living.",
